{"type":"exercise","type_name":"Exercise","number":"","title":"B3: One remainder over every field","title_html":"B3: One remainder over every field","html":"<p>Let <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"F\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D439 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> be any field. Show that\nthe remainder of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"x^{100}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>100</mn></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> on\ndivision by <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"x^2 - 1\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> in <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"F[x]\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D439 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"1\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. Then explain why, over <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Q}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211A TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, evaluating at the roots <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"1\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"-1\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> also finds it, and why that method\nalone does not settle the question over <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{F}_2\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D53D TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">F</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>","file":"ch4/polynomial-division.html"}